{"3408360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Odd Machines: Mechanical Boxes", "steam_appid": 3408360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An exciting 3D escape room puzzle game, where you must solve complex mechanical puzzles, discover hidden objects, and unveil intriguing mysteries!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408360/extras/7201f8fb9431bfe68c0cd23a8927c19b.avif?t=1785767393\" alt=\"The first level to play\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408360/extras_big/7201f8fb9431bfe68c0cd23a8927c19b.avif?t=1785767393 width=800 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a world where cryptic vibes, complex mechanisms, and smooth controls from top escape room games blend to challenge your brain skills. You'll tackle unique puzzle sets on a mysterious, gripping adventure. Every machine is crafted to deliver the ultimate escape and exploration thrill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408360/extras/a2abeeece2b3db4a442dd291a69aa570.avif?t=1785767393\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408360/extras_big/a2abeeece2b3db4a442dd291a69aa570.avif?t=1785767393 width=1560 height=234 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a puzzling adventure with an eclectic mix of original Victorian machinery, classic and architectural enigmas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408360/extras/4220fc946967eb41bc0cee17f0ecf9ed.avif?t=1785767393\" alt=\"A strange machine full of puzzles to solve\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408360/extras_big/4220fc946967eb41bc0cee17f0ecf9ed.avif?t=1785767393 width=800 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408360/extras/11723fcc33896ae1b447e674a24c5fe6.avif?t=1785767393\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408360/extras_big/11723fcc33896ae1b447e674a24c5fe6.avif?t=1785767393 width=1560 height=234 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a mesmerizing world where every move reveals new mysteries and changes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408360/extras/fb0081fdb57734db4078af943358ec5c.avif?t=1785767393\" alt=\"The Temple interior\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408360/extras_big/fb0081fdb57734db4078af943358ec5c.avif?t=1785767393 width=800 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408360/extras/aabd21d6c23a18040e5152717aca064c.avif?t=1785767393\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408360/extras_big/aabd21d6c23a18040e5152717aca064c.avif?t=1785767393 width=1560 height=234 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you get all 8 pieces of the lost stone, you'll be transported into a mystical scene where you'll have to crack numeric puzzles to put the pieces together and finally escape the temple</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"